SUMMARY:🎮 Little Devil Inside [TBC] [TBC]
DESCRIPTION:Game Release: Little Devil Inside [TBC] [TBC]\\nGenre: Adventure\, RPG\\nPlatforms: Xbox\, PS4\, Linux\, PS5\, Xbox One\\n\\nTaking the RPG genre and tossing in survival elements sounds like a great idea. Little Devil Inside is a unique-looking title that looks to do just that. This action RPG has familiar settings with a twist on the genre as players are tasked to survive in the surreal setting.\\n\\nPowered by ZR Consulting — www.zrconsulting.de
