BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260101
SUMMARY:🎮 Judas [TBC] [TBC]
DESCRIPTION:Game Release: Judas [TBC] [TBC]\\nGenre: Action\, Adventure\, Shooter\\nPlatforms: Xbox\, PC\, PS5\\n\\nA deteriorating starship. A last-ditch escape scheme. You assume the enigmatic and tormented role of Judas. Your sole chance of survival hinges on forging or shattering alliances with your most formidable adversaries. Will you collaborate to mend what you've shattered\, or will you let it all succumb to the flames?\\n\\nPowered by ZR Consulting — www.zrconsulting.de
CATEGORIES:Game Release
UID:20260101-rel-87@zrconsulting.de
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
