DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260101
SUMMARY:🎮 ILL [TBC] [TBC]
DESCRIPTION:Game Release: ILL [TBC] [TBC]\\nGenre: Action\, Adventure\, Survival\, Horror\\nPlatforms: PC\, Xbox\, PS5\\n\\nILL NESS is a first-person atmospheric horror action game\, teeming with petrifying alien entities that possess humans\, transforming them into eerie puppets. Unlike many games in the genre\, ILL NESS equips you with potent tools to counter the fear-instilling adversaries.\\n\\nPowered by ZR Consulting — www.zrconsulting.de
CATEGORIES:Game Release
UID:20260101-rel-88@zrconsulting.de
