DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260101
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260101
SUMMARY:🎮 Tides of Annihilation [TBC] [TBC]
DESCRIPTION:Game Release: Tides of Annihilation [TBC] [TBC]\\nGenre: Action\, Adventure\, Hack and Slash\, RPG\\nPlatforms: PS5\, PC\, Xbox\\n\\nWhen the streets of London are engulfed by an Outworld invasion\, the only survivor\, Gwendolyn\, discovers a mysterious power to command the legendary Knights of the Round Table. Driven by vengeance and the desperate need to save her sister\, she embarks on a high-stakes journey across two worlds: a shattered modern London and the mythical Avalon.\\n\\nPowered by ZR Consulting — www.zrconsulting.de
CATEGORIES:Game Release
UID:20260101-rel-90@zrconsulting.de
