SUMMARY:🎮 Spine [TBC] [TBC]
DESCRIPTION:Game Release: Spine [TBC] [TBC]\\nGenre: Action\, Beat 'em Up\\nPlatforms: PC\, PS5\, Switch 2\, Xbox\\n\\nSPINE is a solo\, narrative-driven action game where you step into the shoes of Redline\, a defiant street artist. She is joined by her sentient combat implant\, Spine\, in a daring quest to overthrow the oppressive AI regime of the Tensor Corporation.\\n\\nPowered by ZR Consulting — www.zrconsulting.de
