SUMMARY:🎮 Ghost of Yotei [TBC] [TBC]
DESCRIPTION:Game Release: Ghost of Yotei [TBC] [TBC]\\nGenre: Action\, Adventure\\nPlatforms: PC\\n\\nAtsu's journey takes place in 1603\, more than 300 years after the events of Ghost of Tsushima. Our story is set in the lands surrounding Mount Yotei\, a towering peak in the heart of Ezo\, an area of Japan known as Hokkaido in present day. In 1603\, this area was outside the rule of Japan.\\n\\nPowered by ZR Consulting — www.zrconsulting.de
CATEGORIES:Game Release
UID:20260101-rel-94@zrconsulting.de
