DESCRIPTION:Game Release: Titan Quest 2 [TBC] [TBC]\\nGenre: Action\, Rpg\\nPlatforms: Xbox\, PC\, PS5\\n\\nEmbark on a journey to the classic mythology-inspired world of Titan Quest\, where legendary monsters await and ancient Greece is reimagined in a fantastical way. Engage in intense battles\, toe-to-toe with mythical beasts\, in a landscape filled with wonder and peril.\\n\\nPowered by ZR Consulting — www.zrconsulting.de
