DESCRIPTION:Game Release: SacriFire [TBC] [TBC]\\nGenre: Indie\, Rpg\\nPlatforms: PC\, PS5\, Switch\, PS4\, Xbox\\n\\nSacriFire is an upcoming RPG boasting a unique combat system\, elaborate pixel art\, and music by genre legend Motoi Sakuraba. Ezekiel Ridan\, a young priest\, struggles to keep his faith as the world he loves is threatened by a war between gods and demons.\\n\\nPowered by ZR Consulting — www.zrconsulting.de
