DESCRIPTION:Game Release: Aniimo [TBC] [TBC]\\nGenre: Action\, Rpg\\nPlatforms: iOS\, Android\, Xbox\, PC\, PS5\\n\\nAs a Pathfinder\, you'll begin your journey in Idyll\, a dynamic\, interactive and expansive open world! There\, you can collect\, evolve\, and twine with magical creatures called Aniimo. Get ready to explore uncharted landscapes and mysterious dungeons.\\n\\nPowered by ZR Consulting — www.zrconsulting.de
