DESCRIPTION:Game Release: Showa American Story [TBC] [TBC]\\nGenre: Action\, Adventure\, Rpg\, Sci-Fi\\nPlatforms: PC\, PS5\\n\\nShowa 66\, Japan has bought out most of the United States with its strong economic power. A surge of immigration has firmly planted Japanese culture within the American continent. A mysterious catastrophic incident changes the world drastically.\\n\\nPowered by ZR Consulting — www.zrconsulting.de
